  m_text: 'You broke into a secret facility deep underground, that has been working
    with with time manipulation.



    Thankfully you broke into the right room.
    Too bad that the way back has been blocked and the robotic security has it out
    for you.



    You got to find a way back. Maybe this facility has some weird
    time portal to go back?



    Thankfully you got the Time Splitter clock to
    send you back in time briefly if stuff gets too tough. But weirdly all of these
    rooms look the same and... have you''ve been here before?'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
